@title Add-on Details: how much of its step budget a running engine uses
@area Add-ons
# Lane C3. After the demo engine answered a button, Details says how much of its step budget its
# busiest call used (and warns from half the budget on; the unit tests cover the warning).
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text add-ons
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/addons/demo-engine-0.1.0.kcaddon
click_text "Install from file..."
wait 10
click_text "I trust this file"
wait 4
click_text "Install" Button
wait 12
key Escape
wait 4
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text demo engine panel
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text "Start" Button
wait 10
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text add-ons
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
expect "Its busiest call used"
expect "of its step budget"
shot details-budget
check_layout
